msgid ""
"Which tick cron runs the task. The cadence is a FIELD — a name prefix in the technical name does not affect execution.\n"
"\n"
"Leave empty when `interval_number`/`interval_type` are set: a task uses EITHER a cadence OR an interval, never both."
msgstr ""
"执行此任务的定时调度周期，由字段决定，技术名称前缀不影响执行。\n"
"\n"
"设置 interval_number/interval_type 时请留空。周期和自定义间隔只能二选一。"

